WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.632
Concerts, markets, and crowded streets. Here is how to handle them.

2
00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:12.720
Plan the quiet exit first, before we even go in.

3
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:18.336
Carry earplugs in a pocket. They fit anywhere.

4
00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:25.632
Noise grows slowly through the event. Breaks outside reset our ears.

5
00:00:25.632 --> 00:00:31.344
A break is not leaving early. It is part of the plan.

6
00:00:31.344 --> 00:00:37.824
If it becomes too much, we leave. The door is always there.

7
00:00:37.824 --> 00:00:44.112
Our friends do not have to come with us. We can meet after.

8
00:00:44.112 --> 00:00:49.032
On the way home, quiet helps our body settle.

9
00:00:49.032 --> 00:00:57.240
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

